# Build outputs
bin/
obj/
*.user

# Apple's Developer Disk Image, extracted locally from Xcode — never committed.
# Nor what it is extracted from: an Xcode archive is 2 GB of Apple's binaries,
# and every user downloads their own.
#
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. Written "ddi*/", the pattern also
# matched src/LuminaMonitor.Core/Ddi/ on Windows, where git matches ignore rules
# without regard to case — and silently dropped five source files the solution
# needs, including the image mounter and the TSS client. Anything named ddi*
# lower in the tree is ours; only the root ones are Apple's.
/ddi*/
*.xip
*.dmg
*.pkg

# Working notes and measurement material from a session: screenshots of the
# phone under test, captures, intermediate images. Private by nature.
scratchpad/

# What a run leaves on the disk: the journal, RTP captures, decoded frames.
*.log
*.rtp
*.bmp

# Ce que fabriquent `dotnet publish` et l'empaquetage d'une version.
publish/
LuminaMonitor-*-win-x64.zip
